# MMainDialog — Folder Rules

> Pre-edit hook injects the full `RULES.md` chain. Canonical source: `app.vigil/src/components/molecules/MMainDialog/RULES.md`.

## Consumer pattern (CRITICAL)

- Use `isFooterless` for all create/edit flows — form molecule owns submit/cancel
- `title` is always an i18n key — component calls `$t()` internally
- `:key="editingEntity?.id ?? 'new'"` on the form molecule is mandatory
- Place inside `<aside>` at end of view; hide `#actions` with `v-if="!dialogVisible"`
- See `celer-07-view-patterns.mdc` and `UsersView.view.vue`

## Component contract

- `appendTo="self"` — mask scoped to `<main>`; requires `TheLayout`'s `transform-[translateZ(0)]`
- Global `<style>` (not scoped) — required for teleported elements and scroll lock
- `main-dialog-root` class — required for animation + `main:has(.main-dialog-root) .main-scroll`
- Never pass pre-translated strings to `title` or button labels
- Never use for destructive confirms — use `useConfirm()` + `ConfirmPopup`
